{
  "zfVersion": "1.0",
  "name": "Decision journal",
  "description": "A decision journal as one inline step: the decision, its context, the options weighed, your rationale, the outcome you expect and a date to review it — cross-checked on creation so you can learn from it later. Offline, no AI.",
  "author": "ZettelFlow",
  "difficulty": "medium",
  "canvas": {
    "filename": "Decision journal.canvas",
    "content": "{\"nodes\":[{\"id\":\"dcn-root\",\"type\":\"text\",\"x\":-180,\"y\":-40,\"width\":340,\"height\":250,\"color\":\"5\",\"text\":\"Decision journal\",\"zettelflowConfig\":\"{\\\"slug\\\":\\\"dcn\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Decision journal\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"DEVELOP\\\",\\\"color\\\":\\\"5\\\",\\\"targetFolder\\\":\\\"Decisions\\\",\\\"actions\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"prompt\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"dcn-decision\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Decision\\\",\\\"hasUI\\\":true,\\\"key\\\":\\\"decision\\\",\\\"zone\\\":\\\"context\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Decision\\\",\\\"placeholder\\\":\\\"What are you deciding?\\\",\\\"staticBehaviour\\\":false},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"prompt\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"dcn-context\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Context\\\",\\\"hasUI\\\":true,\\\"key\\\":\\\"context\\\",\\\"zone\\\":\\\"context\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Context\\\",\\\"placeholder\\\":\\\"Why now? What's at stake?\\\",\\\"staticBehaviour\\\":false},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"prompt\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"dcn-options\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Options\\\",\\\"hasUI\\\":true,\\\"key\\\":\\\"options\\\",\\\"zone\\\":\\\"context\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Options\\\",\\\"placeholder\\\":\\\"What did you weigh?\\\",\\\"staticBehaviour\\\":false},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"prompt\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"dcn-rationale\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Rationale\\\",\\\"hasUI\\\":true,\\\"key\\\":\\\"rationale\\\",\\\"zone\\\":\\\"context\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Rationale\\\",\\\"placeholder\\\":\\\"Why this one?\\\",\\\"staticBehaviour\\\":false},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"prompt\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"dcn-expected\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Expected outcome\\\",\\\"hasUI\\\":true,\\\"key\\\":\\\"expected\\\",\\\"zone\\\":\\\"context\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Expected outcome\\\",\\\"placeholder\\\":\\\"What you expect to see...\\\",\\\"staticBehaviour\\\":false},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"calendar\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"dcn-review\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Review on\\\",\\\"hasUI\\\":true,\\\"key\\\":\\\"reviewOn\\\",\\\"zone\\\":\\\"frontmatter\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Review on\\\",\\\"staticBehaviour\\\":false,\\\"enableTime\\\":false,\\\"format\\\":\\\"YYYY-MM-DD\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"selector\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"dcn-conf\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Confidence\\\",\\\"hasUI\\\":true,\\\"key\\\":\\\"confidence\\\",\\\"zone\\\":\\\"frontmatter\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Confidence\\\",\\\"staticBehaviour\\\":false,\\\"defaultOption\\\":\\\"medium\\\",\\\"options\\\":[[\\\"low\\\",\\\"Low\\\"],[\\\"medium\\\",\\\"Medium\\\"],[\\\"high\\\",\\\"High\\\"]]},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"tags\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"dcn-tags\\\",\\\"hasUI\\\":true,\\\"staticBehaviour\\\":false}],\\\"onCreation\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"find-related\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"dcn-rel\\\",\\\"hasUI\\\":false,\\\"key\\\":\\\"related\\\",\\\"zone\\\":\\\"frontmatter\\\",\\\"limit\\\":10},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"find-contradiction\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"dcn-con\\\",\\\"hasUI\\\":false,\\\"key\\\":\\\"contradictions\\\",\\\"zone\\\":\\\"frontmatter\\\"}],\\\"body\\\":\\\"# {{decision}}\\\\n\\\\n## Context\\\\n\\\\n{{context}}\\\\n\\\\n## Options\\\\n\\\\n{{options}}\\\\n\\\\n## Rationale\\\\n\\\\n{{rationale}}\\\\n\\\\n**Expected.** {{expected}}\\\\n\\\\n**Review on.** {{reviewOn}} · **Confidence.** {{confidence}}\\\\n\\\\n## Tensions\\\\n\\\\n{{contradictions}}\\\\n\\\\n## Related\\\\n\\\\n{{related}}\\\\n\\\"}\"}],\"edges\":[]}"
  },
  "steps": []
}
